From 778a91597c587f014826ccf77fe8155fae947403 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 10:58:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-130: several IO lamps / buttons with different
 values show the row empty; a new component goes on top of its container
 (0.130.0)

- lib/mixed.js: io.* fields (LEDStyle, Value, Blink, Style, Down, colours) count in the
  values-differ check, like the layout / look fields already did.
- extension.js cmdAdd: with a non-container selected, the new component is inserted at the
  end of that component's container (WPF: placed in front of other elements in the active
  container element), still positioned under the selected one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
